From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:15:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] soc: qcom: pmic_glink: Leave the battery to the EC on the X2
 Surfaces

The Surface Pro 12th Edition, the Surface Pro 12in 2nd Edition and the
Surface Laptop 13in 2nd Edition report their battery and charger
through SAM, and their firmware disables the pmic_glink battery and
power source for Windows (_STA returns 0), as on the Surface Laptop 8.
List them with it, so user space sees one battery.

Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
 drivers/soc/qcom/pmic_glink.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/soc/qcom/pmic_glink.c b/drivers/soc/qcom/pmic_glink.c
index da011cc..73f19f8 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/qcom/pmic_glink.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/qcom/pmic_glink.c
@@ -64,6 +64,9 @@ static DEFINE_MUTEX(__pmic_glink_lock);
 static const char *const pmic_glink_ec_battery_machines[] = {
 	"microsoft,surface-laptop-8-13p8",
 	"microsoft,surface-laptop-8-15",
+	"microsoft,surface-laptop-13in-2nd-edition",
+	"microsoft,surface-pro-12in-2nd-edition",
+	"microsoft,surface-pro-12th-edition",
 	NULL
 };
 
